><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Accompany Hercules during his time labour!<br></li><li>Terrific Time Management.<br></li><li>Three modes of difficulty.<br></li><li>Fascinating and different tasks on each level.<br></li><li>Play 56 thrilling levels.<br></li><li>Explore sublevels, bonus levels and super bonus levels.<br></li><li>Easy to learn, hard to master: many ways to complete a level.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475650/extras/9528ec4d55ef9fc6a7f3a1ffa35a5b64.avif?t=1696321844\" /></div><br><br><strong>Come and play our latest VR game! </strong>",
